{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/claude-code-settings.json",
  "_comment": "Relay-first project permissions for obsidia-x108-proofs. Claude = TRANSPORT_INTERFACE + COGNITIVE_RESOURCE_ON_DEMAND, CLAUDE_AUTHORITY = NONE. Direct repository mutation primitives (Edit / Write / NotebookEdit / git mutation / filesystem mutation) are denied by default. Governed mutation goes only through the Obsidia relay + Stage 4 rail + KX108. Read / Glob / Grep / bounded read-only git / the bounded relay CLI stay available. Host deny is NOT execution authority: STACK_OPERATION_OWNER = OBSIDIA_CANONICAL_STACK, KX_DECISION_AUTHORITY = KX108_ONLY. Deploy verified by a cold-start session running the section-6 matrix.",
